112
00:09:24.897 --> 00:09:26.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我已经没法解开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:09:26.983 --> 00:09:31.445 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要么她自己破解 要么杀了施术者</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:34.365 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让剑气消失 只有两种选择</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:09:34.448 --> 00:09:38.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然了 前面那种她绝对做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:09:38.661 --> 00:09:41.539 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么 我只能杀掉你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:09:41.622 --> 00:09:43.291 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那也是不可能的</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:43.374 --> 00:09:48.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>人这种生物 意外地容易被暗示</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:49.255 --> 00:09:50.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>心之一方就是利用这点</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:50.464 --> 00:09:54.677 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用极高的剑气压倒敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.804 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让人无法动弹的秘技</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:56.887 --> 00:10:00.808 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>暗示可以对身体产生作用！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:10:00.891 --> 00:10:04.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>身为施术者的我也不例外！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:14.196 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾乃…不败！</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:10:14.989 --> 00:10:16.324 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:10:16.407 --> 00:10:19.243 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他向自己施加强烈的暗示</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:10:19.327 --> 00:10:22.204 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要激发出全部的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:23.914 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:10:23.998 --> 00:10:25.041 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>乃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:25.124 --> 00:10:26.167 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无敌！</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:34.717 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾乃…最强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:36.052 --> 00:10:40.014 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>心之一方的衍生技“凭鬼之术”</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:44.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>离开新选组后 我就没再用过</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:45.102 --> 00:10:47.271 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经过去十五年了</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:55.863 --> 00:10:58.324 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然是卑鄙的手段</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:59.659 --> 00:11:01.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就让我用吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:11:02.036 --> 00:11:05.873 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无妨 你想用什么招数便用</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:11:06.916 --> 00:11:07.792 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.926 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然我说了要杀你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:20.596 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的死亡就已经注定！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:11:33.526 --> 00:11:36.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…拔刀术的架势</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:11:37.321 --> 00:11:39.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“拔刀术”</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:43.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一种从剑鞘中拔出剑刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:11:43.577 --> 00:11:47.415 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>使剑速达到两倍或三倍</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:11:47.498 --> 00:11:50.668 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一瞬间斩杀敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:11:50.751 --> 00:11:53.921 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>追求一击必杀的强力招数</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:54.004 --> 00:11:55.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:55.464 --> 00:11:59.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会让你切身体会
我这“拔刀斋”名号的由来</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:12:00.511 --> 00:12:05.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神速剑法飞天御剑流使用的拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:12:05.724 --> 00:12:07.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以说是最快的拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:12:08.436 --> 00:12:10.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…如果躲过这一击 我就赢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:14.191 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>由于拔刀术追求的是一击必杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:12:14.275 --> 00:12:18.195 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一招失败
反而会导致自己的灭亡 很有风险</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:12:19.488 --> 00:12:20.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能躲过吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:12:24.285 --> 00:12:25.453 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:12:25.536 --> 00:12:26.579 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能躲过这一招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:12:27.663 --> 00:12:29.415 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一决胜负吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:29.498 --> 00:12:31.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:34.879 --> 00:12:39.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋 你忽略了一个致命的问题</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:39.133 --> 00:12:40.551 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:41.218 --> 00:12:43.721 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀会对拔刀术造成障碍</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:43.804 --> 00:12:48.684 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃凸出的弧度在出鞘时</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:48.767 --> 00:12:51.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会略微降低拔刀的速度</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:51.479 --> 00:12:54.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点延迟就是我绝好的胜利机会！</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:58.527 --> 00:13:01.697 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快！不过我能躲过去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:13:03.908 --> 00:13:05.367 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该我出招了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:13:05.451 --> 00:13:08.621 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我赢了 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:15.836 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么…这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:18.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同时用了刀身和刀鞘的</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>两段拔刀术？</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:13:23.052 --> 00:13:26.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流拔刀术 “双龙闪”</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:30.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀术是一击必杀的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:30.559 --> 00:13:34.605 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也很清楚逆刃刀不适合用拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:13:34.688 --> 00:13:38.275 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对所有拔刀术了如指掌的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:13:38.359 --> 00:13:41.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这便是“拔刀斋”这个志士名的由来</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:13:42.112 --> 00:13:44.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我击碎了你的肘关节 打断了筋脉</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:13:45.533 --> 00:13:47.952 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的剑术生涯已经结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:13:48.035 --> 00:13:50.746 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:13:50.829 --> 00:13:52.540 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你生命的终结</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:58.921 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:14:10.641 --> 00:14:12.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:14.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在犹豫什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:14:15.104 --> 00:14:18.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要解除心之一方
只有杀了我一条路</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:14:19.608 --> 00:14:21.902 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多么简单的选择</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:14:22.653 --> 00:14:25.656 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中的刽子手的凶刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:14:25.739 --> 00:14:29.243 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>朝这里砍 送我下黄泉吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:14:30.077 --> 00:14:31.537 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.373 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不想成全你</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:14:34.957 --> 00:14:40.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但为了保护薰小姐
我现在要再做一次刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:14:42.172 --> 00:14:43.632 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就对了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:14:43.716 --> 00:14:47.428 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中杀人剑的滋味
让我刃卫好好品尝吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:14:47.511 --> 00:14:48.387 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:52.391 --> 00:14:56.353 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑为凶器 剑术为杀人术</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:56.437 --> 00:15:01.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管修饰的多么冠冕堂皇
这终究是事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:15:01.483 --> 00:15:04.862 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但比起事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:15:05.946 --> 00:15:10.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下却更喜欢薰小姐的天真戏言…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:15:12.494 --> 00:15:13.495 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:15:16.832 --> 00:15:18.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:15:19.293 --> 00:15:22.004 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要！</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:15:26.133 --> 00:15:28.677 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要变回…刽子手…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:15:29.178 --> 00:15:31.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀人剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:15:31.263 --> 00:15:32.514 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…可以…</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:33.766 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:15:34.516 --> 00:15:37.478 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 醒醒！你还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:38.979 --> 00:15:40.105 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:41.106 --> 00:15:43.901 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事…剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:43.984 --> 00:15:45.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:15:46.028 --> 00:15:47.947 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说话的方式…</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:49.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又变回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:51.158 --> 00:15:52.660 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:53.285 --> 00:15:55.871 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没事 所以…</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:57.665 --> 00:16:00.918 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>昨晚那个鸡窝头
能解开我的秘术也就算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:16:01.001 --> 00:16:02.795 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到连这个小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:16:02.878 --> 00:16:05.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都能解开我的心之一方</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:09.301 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来我也变弱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:16:09.969 --> 00:16:11.220 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>停手吧 刃卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:16:11.845 --> 00:16:17.935 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有一把腰刀
还只能用左手 你毫无胜算</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:16:18.018 --> 00:16:19.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一切都结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:16:20.187 --> 00:16:22.439 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好接受现实吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.317 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 还没结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:29.488 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事要了结…</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:36.078 --> 00:16:38.872 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这感觉…我喜欢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:49.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别一副什么都不懂的表情</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:50.259 --> 00:16:51.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我告诉你了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:52.678 --> 00:16:54.805 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事要了结</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:54.888 --> 00:16:58.726 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>万一…万一我被抓住…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:58.809 --> 00:17:00.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>随着调查进行</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:17:01.061 --> 00:17:03.397 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们一定会找到指使我进行暗杀的</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:07.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>道貌岸然的新政府政客</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:17:07.484 --> 00:17:08.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:17:10.029 --> 00:17:12.698 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你认为到了明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:17:12.781 --> 00:17:16.410 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就不需要刽子手了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:16.994 --> 00:17:20.247 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是为什么我说你没出息了</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:25.961 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新也好 明治也好 新政府也罢</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:31.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>本质上还是和幕末一样
继续着权力的斗争</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:32.009 --> 00:17:34.053 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>挡路的人一律除掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:34.136 --> 00:17:39.850 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只不过如今制度近代化了
警察机关也重整了</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:39.933 --> 00:17:44.313 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没法光明正大不加掩饰地杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:44.396 --> 00:17:49.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同时 一度踏上修罗之路的我
无法脱身</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:49.276 --> 00:17:51.195 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也不想脱身</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:51.278 --> 00:17:55.282 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当政治家和刽子手利害一致</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:55.365 --> 00:18:00.037 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>暴徒“黑笠”就诞生了</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:18:00.621 --> 00:18:03.832 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“刽子手凭自己的意志杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:18:03.916 --> 00:18:07.419 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不能选择自己的目标”</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:11.632 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我违背了这条规则 向你发出挑战</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:18:11.715 --> 00:18:15.094 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果落得这般下场</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:18:15.177 --> 00:18:16.595 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>罢了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:21.975 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着残缺的右手活下去也没意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:23.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:27.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别用这种眼神看着我 拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:27.356 --> 00:18:32.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说要杀我那时的眼神更好</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:34.154 --> 00:18:37.407 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的本性果然还是个刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:37.491 --> 00:18:40.744 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>同是刽子手的我不会说错</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:40.828 --> 00:18:44.957 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手到死都是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:48.210 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为不了其他的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:48.293 --> 00:18:52.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个浪客能当多久</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:55.676 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会在地狱深处好好见证的</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:19:07.479 --> 00:19:11.525 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“刽子手到死都是刽子手”</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:17.656 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“到死都是…”</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:19:19.908 --> 00:19:20.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:19:22.661 --> 00:19:24.955 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回去吧 薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:25.539 --> 00:19:27.833 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来的事情 与我们无关</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:28.542 --> 00:19:30.169 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>交给警察吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:37.968 --> 00:19:38.927 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:41.013 --> 00:19:42.055 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:43.724 --> 00:19:45.100 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:45.726 --> 00:19:48.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你救了我</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:48.228 --> 00:19:50.147 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最起码让我说句谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:52.733 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:53.483 --> 00:19:55.736 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下才应该道谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.529 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>感激不尽</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃…不客气？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:20:01.575 --> 00:20:05.162 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时要不是薰小姐阻止了在下…</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:20:05.245 --> 00:20:09.041 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就完全变回刽子手拔刀斋了</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:20:11.084 --> 00:20:14.004 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 你的靛蓝色发带</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:20:14.087 --> 00:20:15.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>得还给你来着</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:20:15.714 --> 00:20:16.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.176 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:20:19.259 --> 00:20:21.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么？全都是血！</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:20:21.428 --> 00:20:23.263 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:20:23.347 --> 00:20:27.601 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定是我左肩出血时
血流到怀里把它浸透了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:20:27.684 --> 00:20:29.102 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你干的好事</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:20:29.186 --> 00:20:30.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是不可抗力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:20:31.605 --> 00:20:33.398 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好过分 我不会放过你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:20:34.399 --> 00:20:35.734 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:20:35.817 --> 00:20:37.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:20:41.698 --> 00:20:46.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫 在九泉之下好好看着吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:20:47.162 --> 00:20:49.706 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算本性是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:50.666 --> 00:20:52.960 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会用余生来压制给你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:53.543 --> 00:20:58.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下再也不会成为刽子手拔刀斋了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:21:04.721 --> 00:21:09.559 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下到死为止
都要做一个不杀人的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:21:09.643 --> 00:21:11.019 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:21:11.728 --> 00:21:12.980 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:47.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《逃命的美女》</c.simplifiedchinese>

